        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Rasterising layers to bitmaps\n\n`image/from-layer` (Rasterize) draws a layer onto an offscreen canvas and outputs it as an image. Once you're in image-land you can sample, filter, blend, save, …\n\nHere: a fibonacci scatter rasterised at 256×256 and then displayed back via draw/image.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Rasterising layers to bitmaps\n\n`image/from-layer` (Rasterize) draws a layer onto an offscreen canvas and outputs it as an image. Once you're in image-land you can sample, filter, blend, save, …\n\nHere: a fibonacci scatter rasterised at 256×256 and then displayed back via draw/image.",
